Top-k MoE fusion boundary corrections. The inclusive allocation-lifetime
endpoint derives from halo-box/strix-llama.cpp commit
f6ade7dc76c400067c2918b4132fede4198615cf (MIT). Local bounds checks also
cover a terminal or partially present normalization suffix. No kernel math
or fusion eligibility is widened. test-topk-moe-lifetime.cpp checks the
reported lifetime endpoints without model inference.

